 followup:{moves:'action result',len:[30,100],hints:['What exactly did you do yourself?','What was the result?','What would you change next time?'],why:['It answers the exact follow-up question instead of repeating the first answer.','It adds new detail about the candidate\'s own contribution.','It finishes with an outcome.']}
